   Element selectors are (0,3,1) here - above megaform, below every authored class rule - and
   <i> is left alone so Font Awesome keeps its own family. */
.mfp.mfp-jba.mfp-native-generated label,.mfp.mfp-jba.mfp-native-generated span,.mfp.mfp-jba.mfp-native-generated p,.mfp.mfp-jba.mfp-native-generated div,.mfp.mfp-jba.mfp-native-generated ul,.mfp.mfp-jba.mfp-native-generated li,.mfp.mfp-jba.mfp-native-generated h1,.mfp.mfp-jba.mfp-native-generated h2,.mfp.mfp-jba.mfp-native-generated h3,.mfp.mfp-jba.mfp-native-generated button{font-family:inherit!important}
